# Local-dev settings for the realtime worker. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored).
# INVENTORY.md § 4 says who issues each of these.

# The live-channel fence. A joining socket resolves the caller's account scope
# through the same guard corridor the API uses, so a client-portal login hears
# only its own world. With no token the team channel refuses EVERY socket — the
# fail-closed direction, but it costs live sync until this is set.
CF_D1_TOKEN=
INTERNAL_KEY=
